{"id":"Prowl.OrigamiUI.SliderBuilder","name":"SliderBuilder","display":"SliderBuilder","kind":"class","assembly":"Prowl.Origami","namespace":"Prowl.OrigamiUI","outer":null,"signature":"public sealed class SliderBuilder<T> where T : struct, INumber<T>","bases":[],"docs":{"summary":"Fluent builder for a single-thumb slider. Construct via the `Origami.Slider` / `Origami.IntSlider` factories (or the generic [`Slider<T>`](#api~Prowl.OrigamiUI.Origami~Slider)) and call [`Show`](#api~Prowl.OrigamiUI.SliderBuilder~Show) to render.","remarks":"Generic on `T` — works with any `INumber<T>`: float, double, decimal, int, long, etc. Math goes through `double` internally (or `decimal` for `decimal`) to keep the value mapping precise across the full numeric range.\n\nOne layout box for the track (with all canvas drawing), one optional inline [`NumericFieldBuilder<T>`](#api~Prowl.OrigamiUI.NumericFieldBuilder) on the right. Tooltip during drag floats above the thumb on [`PopupLayer`](#api~Prowl.OrigamiUI.Origami~PopupLayer)."},"attributes":[],"members":[{"kind":"method","name":"Variant","signature":"public SliderBuilder<T> Variant(OrigamiVariant v)","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":159,"path":"Origami/Origami/Widgets/Slider.cs","anchor":"Variant"},{"kind":"method","name":"Primary","signature":"public SliderBuilder<T> Primary()","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":160,"path":"Origami/Origami/Widgets/Slider.cs","anchor":"Primary"},{"kind":"method","name":"Success","signature":"public SliderBuilder<T> Success()","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":161,"path":"Origami/Origami/Widgets/Slider.cs","anchor":"Success"},{"kind":"method","name":"Warning","signature":"public SliderBuilder<T> Warning()","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":162,"path":"Origami/Origami/Widgets/Slider.cs","anchor":"Warning"},{"kind":"method","name":"Danger","signature":"public SliderBuilder<T> Danger()","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":163,"path"